       uuppddaattee--mmiimmee--ddaattaabbaassee --hh | --vv | [ --VV | --nn ] _M_I_M_E_-_D_I_R


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       uuppddaattee--mmiimmee--ddaattaabbaassee is a program which is responsible for updating the
       shared  mime-info cache according to the system described in the Shared
       MIME-Info                    Database                     specification
       ⟨http://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Specifications/shared-mime-info-spec⟩
       from the X Desktop Group.


