       --hh     Print out a command summary.

       --vv     Print out the version information.

       --VV     Be verbose.

       --nn     Only update if MMIIMMEE--DDIIRR/packages/ or a file in that directory is
              newer than MMIIMMEE--DDIIRR/version. This is useful for package pre- and
              post-installation scripts.


